    dcterms:description "SCOPE-AND-LIMITATIONS.md and the SONY-READINESS-GAP-CLOSURE.md 'Disclosed scope, not laundered' convention communicate real system limitations and control boundaries in writing, and the SOC2-CONTROL-MAPPING.md doc is itself an internal communication artifact about control coverage; but no control is mapped to CC2 in SOC2-CONTROL-MAPPING.md, and there is no evidence of a formal internal/external communication or incident-reporting policy beyond these docs." .

[] a prov:Entity ;
